  "id_str": "1979379254577238517",
  "text": "Pay close attention to the \"EMA Fan\" while these trends start to form. \n\nAvoid trading the areas where these 3 EMA's are tightly spaced and braided together. That is a clear sign of chop or lack of momentum. \n\nWhen those 3 EMA's start to space out and drift apart it's a good sign https://t.co/uGmdFS5WSF",
